#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/mercurial.xml:81
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<xref linkend=\"pypa-build\"/>, <xref linkend=\"docutils\"/> (required to "
"build the documentation), <xref linkend=\"git\"/>, <xref role=\"runtime\" "
"linkend=\"openssh\"/> (runtime, to access ssh://... repositories), <xref "
"linkend=\"pygments\"/>, <xref linkend=\"rust\"/> (see "
"<filename>rust/README.rst</filename> and "
"<filename>rust/rhg/README.md</filename>), <xref linkend=\"subversion\"/> "
"(with Python bindings), <xref linkend=\"uv_build\"/> (for an alternate build"
" method), <xref linkend=\"which\"/> (used in one test), <ulink "
"url=\"https://www.nongnu.org/cvs/\">CVS</ulink>, <ulink "
"url=\"https://pypi.python.org/pypi/pyflakes\">pyflakes</ulink>, and <ulink "
"url=\"https://github.com/google/re2/\">re2</ulink>"
msgstr ""
"<xref linkend=\"pypa-build\"/>, <xref linkend=\"docutils\"/> (exigido para "
"construir a documentação), <xref linkend=\"git\"/>, <xref role=\"runtime\" "
"linkend=\"openssh\"/> (tempo de execução, para acessar repositórios "
"ssh://... ), <xref linkend=\"pygments\"/>, <xref linkend=\"rust\"/> (veja-se"
" <filename>rust/README.rst</filename> e "
"<filename>rust/rhg/README.md</filename>), <xref linkend=\"subversion\"/> "
"(com ligações Python), <xref linkend=\"uv_build\"/> (para um método "
"alternativo de construir), <xref linkend=\"which\"/> (usado em um teste), "
"<ulink url=\"https://www.nongnu.org/cvs/\">CVS</ulink>, <ulink "
"url=\"https://pypi.python.org/pypi/pyflakes\">pyflakes</ulink> e <ulink "
"url=\"https://github.com/google/re2/\">re2</ulink>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/mercurial.xml:101
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Mercurial"
msgstr "Instalação do &quot;Mercurial&quot;"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/mercurial.xml:104
#, xml-text
msgid "First, remove some commands that conflict with openssl4:"
msgstr "Primeiro, remova alguns comandos que conflitam com openssl4:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/mercurial.xml:107
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>sed -i \"15,23 s/^/#/\" setup.py</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>sed -i \"15,23 s/^/#/\" setup.py</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/mercurial.xml:110
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<application>Mercurial</application> is built and installed in a single "
"command as the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"<application>Mercurial</application> é construído e instalado em um comando "
"único como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/mercurial.xml:114
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make PREFIX=/usr install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make PREFIX=/usr install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/mercurial.xml:117
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The documentation is built by the above command (in man and html formats), "
"but only the manual pages are installed. If you wish to install the html "
"documentation, issue as the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"A documentação é construída pelo comando acima (nos formatos man e html), "
"mas somente as páginas de manual são instaladas. Se você desejar instalar a "
"documentação html, emita como o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/mercurial.xml:123
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir /usr/share/doc/mercurial-&mercurial-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -R doc/html /usr/share/doc/mercurial-&mercurial-version;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir /usr/share/doc/mercurial-&mercurial-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -R doc/html /usr/share/doc/mercurial-&mercurial-version;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/mercurial.xml:138
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"In order to run the tests, make sure all the files are owned by an "
"unprivileged user. This fixes a problem with permissions in the build "
"directory since the above <command>install</command> command has created "
"files owned by &root;.  To remedy this, issue, as the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"Para a finalidade de executar os testes, assegure-se de que todos os "
"arquivos sejam titularizados por um(a) usante desprivilegiado(a). Isso "
"corrige um problema com permissões no diretório de construção, já que o "
"comando <command>install</command> acima criou arquivos titularizados "
"pelo(a) &root;. Para remediar isso, emita, como o(a) usante &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/mercurial.xml:146
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>chown -Rv <replaceable>username</replaceable> .</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>chown -Rv <replaceable>username</replaceable> .</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/mercurial.xml:149
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Where <replaceable>username</replaceable> should be replaced with the user "
"name of the person running the tests."
msgstr ""
"Onde <replaceable>username</replaceable> deveria ser substituído pelo nome "
"de usante da pessoa que executa os testes."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/mercurial.xml:154
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The test suite tries to run some tests that are incompatible with <xref "
"linkend=\"rust\"/>.  Remove them with:"
msgstr ""
"A suíte de teste tenta executar alguns testes que são incompatíveis com "
"<xref linkend=\"rust\"/>. Remova-os com:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/mercurial.xml:158
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>sed -i \"177,181 s/^/#/\" Makefile</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>sed -i \"177,181 s/^/#/\" Makefile</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/mercurial.xml:161
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, run the test suite with:"
msgstr "Agora, execute a suíte de teste com:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/mercurial.xml:164
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>TESTFLAGS=\"-j<replaceable>&lt;N&gt;</replaceable> --with-hg "
"/usr/bin/hg\" make check</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>TESTFLAGS=\"-j<replaceable>&lt;N&gt;</replaceable> --with-hg "
"/usr/bin/hg\" make check</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/mercurial.xml:167
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"where <replaceable>&lt;N&gt;</replaceable> is an integer between one and the"
" number of ( processor X threads ), inclusive (default is the total number "
"of processors as returned by <command>nproc</command>).  Tests may fail "
"because some error messages have changed in Python or some deprecation "
"warnings are printed that were not present when the test was designed. Also,"
" some tests use a lot of memory, and may be killed by the kernel if the "
"system is running low on memory."
msgstr ""
"onde <replaceable>&lt;N&gt;</replaceable> é um inteiro entre um e o número "
"de (processador X camadas), inclusive (o padrão é o número total de "
"processadores conforme retornado por <command>nproc</command>). Os testes "
"possivelmente falhem porque algumas mensagens de erro mudaram no Python ou "
"alguns avisos de descontinuação são impressos que não estavam presentes "
"quando o teste foi projetado. Também, alguns testes usam um monte de memória"
" e possivelmente sejam mortos pelo núcleo se o sistema estiver executando "
"com pouca memória."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/mercurial.xml:201
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"In order to investigate any apparently failing tests, you may use the "
"<command>run-tests.py</command> script in the <filename "
"class=\"directory\">tests</filename> directory. To see the almost forty "
"switches, some of them very useful, issue <command>tests/run-tests.py "
"--help</command>.  Running the following commands, you will execute only the"
" tests that failed before:"
msgstr ""
"Para a finalidade de investigar quaisquer testes aparentemente falhos, você "
"pode usar o conjunto de comandos sequenciais <command>run-tests.py</command>"
" no diretório <filename class=\"directory\">tests</filename>. Para ver as "
"quase quarenta chaves, algumas delas muito úteis, emita <command>tests/run-"
"tests.py --help</command>. Executando os seguintes comandos, você executará "
"somente os testes que falharam antes:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/mercurial.xml:211
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>pushd tests  &amp;&amp;\n"
"  ./run-tests.py --with-hg /usr/bin/hg --retest\n"
"popd</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>pushd tests  &amp;&amp;\n"
"  ./run-tests.py --with-hg /usr/bin/hg --retest\n"
"popd</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/mercurial.xml:216
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"An interesting switch is <option>--time</option>, which will generate a "
"table of all the executed tests and their respective start, end, user, "
"system and real times once the tests are complete. Note that these switches "
"may be used with <command>make check</command> by including them in the "
"<envar>TESTFLAGS</envar> environment variable."
msgstr ""
"Uma chave interessante é <option>--time</option>, que gerará uma tabela de "
"todos os testes executados e respectivos tempos de início, fim, usuário(a), "
"sistema e real assim que os testes estiverem completos. Observe que essas "
"chaves possivelmente sejam usadas com <command>make check</command> "
"incluindo-as na variável de ambiente <envar>TESTFLAGS</envar>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/mercurial.xml:224
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"After installation, two very quick and simple tests should run correctly. "
"The first one needs some configuration:"
msgstr ""
"Depois da instalação, dois testes muito rápidos e simples deveriam executar "
"corretamente. O primeiro precisa de alguma configuração:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/mercurial.xml:228
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt;&gt; ~/.hgrc &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>[ui]\n"
"username = <replaceable>&lt;user_name&gt; &lt;user@mail&gt;</replaceable></literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt;&gt; ~/.hgrc &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>[ui]\n"
"username = <replaceable>&lt;nome_usuário(a)&gt; &lt;usuário(a)@correio&gt;</replaceable></literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/mercurial.xml:234
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"where you must replace &lt;user_name&gt; and &lt;user@mail&gt; (mail is "
"optional and can be omitted, but if you keep it, you should also keep the "
"angle brackets <quote>&lt;&gt;</quote>). With the user identity defined, run"
" <command>hg debuginstall</command> and several lines will be displayed, the"
" last one reading \"no problems detected\". Another quick and simple test is"
" just <command>hg</command>, which should output basic commands that can be "
"used with <command>hg</command>."
msgstr ""
"onde você precisa substituir &lt;nome_usuário(a)&gt; e "
"&lt;usuário(a)@correio-eletrônico&gt; (o correio é opcional e pode ser "
"omitido, porém se o mantiver, você deveria manter também as aspas angulares "
"<quote>&lt;&gt;</quote>). Com a identidade do(a) usuário(a) definida, "
"execute <command>hg debuginstall</command> e várias linhas serão exibidas, a"
" última dizendo \"no problems detected\". Outro teste rápido e simples é "
"apenas <command>hg</command>, que deveria gerar comandos básicos que "
"conseguem ser usados com <command>hg</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/mercurial.xml:247
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring Mercurial"
msgstr "Configurando o &quot;Mercurial&quot;"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/mercurial.xml:250
#, xml-text
msgid "Config Files"
msgstr "Arquivos de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/mercurial.xml:253
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<filename>/etc/mercurial/hgrc</filename> and <filename>~/.hgrc</filename>"
msgstr ""
"<filename>/etc/mercurial/hgrc</filename> e <filename>~/.hgrc</filename>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/mercurial.xml:258
#, xml-text
msgid "/etc/mercurial/hgrc"
msgstr "/etc/mercurial/hgrc"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/mercurial.xml:262
#, xml-text
msgid "~/.hgrc"
msgstr "~/.hgrc"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/mercurial.xml:266
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The great majority of extensions are disabled by default. Run <command>hg "
"help extensions</command> if you need to enable any, e.g.  when "
"investigating test failures. This will output a list of enabled and disabled"
" extensions, as well as more information such as how to enable or disable "
"extensions using configuration files."
msgstr ""
"A maioria das extensões está desabilitada por padrão. Execute <command>hg "
"help extensions</command> se precisar habilitar alguma, por exemplo. ao "
"investigar falhas de teste. Isso exibirá uma lista de extensões habilitadas "
"e desabilitadas, bem como mais informações, tais como habilitar ou "
"desabilitar extensões usando arquivos de configuração."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/mercurial.xml:274
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have installed <xref linkend=\"make-ca\"/> and want "
"<application>Mercurial</application> to use the certificates, as the "
"<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user, issue:"
msgstr ""
"Se você tiver instalado o <xref linkend=\"make-ca\"/> e deseja que o "
"<application>Mercurial</application> use os certificados, [então] como o(a) "
"usuário(a) <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>, emita:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/mercurial.xml:279
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -v -d -m755 /etc/mercurial &amp;&amp;\n"
"cat &gt; /etc/mercurial/hgrc &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>[web]\n"
"cacerts = /etc/pki/tls/certs/ca-bundle.crt</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -v -d -m755 /etc/mercurial &amp;&amp;\n"
"cat &gt; /etc/mercurial/hgrc &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>[web]\n"
"cacerts = /etc/pki/tls/certs/ca-bundle.crt</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

